{
  "name": "Kualat: Bulk shorten links from Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Bulk shorten links from Google Sheets\n\nPaste a list of URLs in a sheet, run the workflow once, and every row gets its kua.lat short URL written back next to it. Rows without a Destination are skipped.\n\nThe sheet needs these columns in the first row: `Destination` (required), `Alias` (optional custom alias), `Description` (optional), `Short URL` (filled in by the workflow).\n\n**Set up:**\n1. Install the **@kualat/n8n-nodes-kualat** community node under Settings → Community Nodes.\n2. Create a **Kualat API** credential (API URL, for example `https://kua.lat/api`, and an API key).\n3. Prepare the sheet, copy its URL into both Google Sheets nodes and pick the sheet tab.\n4. Click **Execute workflow**, then check the sheet — each row now shows its short URL.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "g7000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "How to use",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-480, -160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "g7000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "When clicking Execute",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "sheet",
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "url"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Sheet1",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "g7000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Read Rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [260, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "g7000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000a0",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.Destination }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "g7000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Row Has a URL?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [520, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "link",
        "operation": "create",
        "url": "={{ $json.Destination }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "custom": "={{ $json.Alias }}",
          "description": "={{ $json.Description }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "g7000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Create Link",
      "type": "@kualat/n8n-nodes-kualat.kualat",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [780, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "sheet",
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "url"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Sheet1",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "row_number": "={{ $('Read Rows').item.json.row_number }}",
            "Short URL": "={{ $json.short_url }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [
            "row_number"
          ],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "g7000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Write Short URL",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [1040, 0]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "When clicking Execute": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read Rows",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read Rows": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Row Has a URL?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Row Has a URL?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Create Link",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Create Link": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Write Short URL",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {},
  "pinData": {}
}
